# Public values only: everything EXPO_PUBLIC_* is compiled into the app and visible to anyone
# who has it. Never put secrets here (the app uses a public OAuth client: PKCE, no secret).
# Optional: copy to .env (git-ignored) and adjust, then restart `npx expo start`.
#
# Leave these unset for local development: the app then uses the computer that serves it
# through Metro (e.g. http://192.168.1.20:3000 and :8180), which works on a phone on the same
# Wi-Fi and on the emulator. Set them only to point somewhere else, e.g. USB + adb reverse:
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000/api/v1
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_KEYCLOAK_URL=http://localhost:8180
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_KEYCLOAK_URL=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_KEYCLOAK_REALM=ai-job-assistant
# EXPO_PUBLIC_KEYCLOAK_CLIENT_ID=ai-job-assistant-mobile
